# eslint-snapshot-rule-tester format: v1


Test: gantt-no-unread-tag >> invalid >>> docs/rules/gantt-no-unread-tag.md incorrect 1
Filename: gantt-no-unread-tag-incorrect-1.mmd

Code:
  1 | gantt
  2 |   dateFormat YYYY-MM-DD
  3 |   Design :Done, 2024-01-06, 3d
    |           ^~~~ [1]
